# Dear Data 100 - Plan

## Dataset
- 147 workouts tracked in Hevy
- Exported as CSV (date, exercise, sets, reps, weight)
- Contains anomalies (missed days, typos, outliers)

## Goal
Turn the data into clear visuals using Java.

## Steps
1. Export Hevy data to CSV
2. Clean data (find and note anomalies)
3. Write Java code to read the CSV
4. Pick what to show (volume, PRs, frequency)
5. Build the visual output
6. Write up findings and reflection

## Questions
- Which anomalies matter?
- What's the best way to show progress over time?